      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T20:22:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "what if the shrinker sets page_ptr to NULL after this check? Doesn\u0027t binder_lru_page need to be protected?",
      "revId": "cba0dd82a60df879b05f8887eacf6faf78ab002b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2be50765_7e6898c4",
        "filename": "drivers/android/binder_alloc.c",
