      "message": "Same as above, this range is also PAGE_ALIGED(). However, this expects an _exclusive_ range. So _no_ pages shared with other buffers. In most cases (since transactions are typically less-than a page size) this means that `end \u003d\u003d start` so we don\u0027t even enter the loop most of the time.\n\nI can add more comments to explain all these concepts.",
